          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wukweti musoŋu wambumba akavwalaŋa mahina ataboka, nsuki jindi jesasa hohu, akajikaŋa hamuvumbu windi wahewulu, akabilelaŋa nindi, Majilu! Majilu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.45",
