          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafuku ejima akekalayi namusoŋu akekali wamajilu hohu; wamajilu kwindi; akashakamaŋa kanka windi, akashakamaŋa kunsa yachilombu.",
