          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neyi musoŋu anawukosi dehi, kapristu akatali; neyi wakamona musoŋu mwomwawuhohu, nimusoŋu kuya nakuswila nehi, wamajilu; akawochi mukesibwi-i, dinadiiki tuhu hela neyi dinapeleki mukachi indi kwiji hewulu.",
