              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi kapristu wakatala, neyi wakamona musoŋu hiwukujimaŋana chanawukosuwu dehi, akawutabuli mwihina dakuvwala, hela muchitembi, hela munjila yehina hela munketula; ",
